OL,3,AUK temperatures to rise to 23C before
OL,4,Aautumn chill sets in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThursday will bring unusually high
OL,7,Ftemperatures as warm air wafts across
OL,8,Fthe south of the UK, while colder
OL,9,Fconditions dig into northern areas.
OL,11,FAfternoon highs in parts of eastern
OL,12,FEngland are likely to be about 5-8C
OL,13,F(9-14F) above typical mid-October
OL,14,Fvalues, probably peaking at 23C (73F).
OL,16,FIt will be a different story further
OL,17,Fnorth and west with temperatures in
OL,18,Fmuch of Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,19,Fsitting around the seasonal norm.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
