OL,3,AUK temperatures to rise to 23C before
OL,4,Aautumn chill sets in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two air masses are divided by a
OL,7,Fweather front which will bring
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain. As that sinks
OL,9,Fsouthwards, chillier air will spread to
OL,10,Fall parts of the country bringing a
OL,11,Fcolder feel to the weekend, though
OL,12,Fthere will still be plenty of sunshine.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
